# UI

- `View` — MonoBehaviour, SerializeField widgets, no game rules
- `Presenter` — plain C#, implements `IPresenter` (`IInitializable` + `IDisposable`), owns screen logic
- Create views via `ViewsFactory` / presenters via `*PresentersFactory`; register in context
- Screen presenters Tick from bootstrap when they need per-frame updates — not from random MB Updates
